 blocks.\n\nFor each duplicate, ask the user:\n- **Fill empty fields** → update the CRM record with new data where fields are empty. NEVER overwrite existing data without asking.\n- **Different data** → show both versions, let the user choose which to keep.\n- **Skip** → don't touch this contact.\n","confidence":0.75,"evidence":{},"finding":"without asking","finding_ids":["finding-37b5dff451994900b06ef34efcc93871"],"id":"sha256:dad530def07a171e841f3aadebe3d5e861529f86683b4093b8ea9eab10fa4861","intent":null,"line":93,"match_fingerprint":"8dc77d3dce9ba1f2672e813265a1b1a0c8594866ef38a4e978bf4f4451795465","message":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-37b5dff451994900b06ef34efcc93871","line":93,"path":"SKILL.md","start_column":116}],"path":"SKILL.md","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"EA2","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":116,"tags":["Excessive Agency"]},{"category":"Excessive Agency","code_snippet":"\n- **Separate connector required:** This skill works only through a separately connected CRM MCP. Do not hardcode CRM-specific logic or imply that FullEnrich MCP provides CRM tools.\n- **NEVER overwrite existing CRM data** without explicit user permission. Fill empty fields = OK. Replace existing data = ALWAYS ask.\n- **NEVER push without confirmation.** Always show the summary (new/update/skip counts) and wait for \"yes\".\n- **Duplicate detection is critical.** Always check for existing contacts before creating new ones. Duplicate records in a CRM are a major pain point for sales teams.\n- **Field mapping varies per CRM.** Some CRMs have \"Phone\", others have \"Phone Number\", others have \"Mobile Phone\" + \"Work Phone\". Always check the CRM schema and adapt.\n- **Custom fields:** Many CRMs have custom fields (e.g. \"Lead Source\", \"Enrichment Date\"). Ask the user if they want to populate these.","confidence":0.75,"evidence":{},"finding":"without confirmation","finding_ids":["finding-8231f5628f224c86816f461061cd654d"],"id":"sha256:b1b94635a48bc2251c2f90365accb92d656248d7b2f2f6646288c46411bc1a2f","intent":null,"line":134,"match_fingerprint":"185d22f157da5a84d02dff9686fa7f147180d794b4c7e43df099ae9daa3d598e","message":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-8231f5628f224c86816f461061cd654d","line":134,"path":"SKILL.md","start_column":15}],"path":"SKILL.md","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"EA2","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":15,"tags":["Excessive Agency"]}],"findings_truncated":false,"freshness":"current","id":"plugin:community:43d4c0038debd51094d2e3c10a4e94dc/full-crm","kind":"plugin_skill","plugin_path":"","profile":{"digest":"sha256:a73e7c4a9fa0ac563a885c541d207e90dde2e248ca426f7824cf429d725db921","id":"static-standard-v3"},"raw_finding_count":2,"report_digest":"sha256:f8d95a815f9ac3910dc2900c630523066bddc4a0134ff300211d5d3bfb0864df","retry":{"attempt_count":1,"disposition":"none","latest_status":"complete","next_attempt_at":null,"next_profile":null,"reason":"complete"},"scanned_at":"2026-10-30T17:08:08Z","scanner":{"id":"skillspector","revision":"f3b25697d76256998ca9d42c198d256258d4c035","version":"2.13.1"},"skill_name"